#: src/idscanner/__init__.py:18
msgid ""
"ID Scanner needs Tk, the graphical toolkit for Python, which is missing."
msgstr ""
"ID Scanner treba Tk, grafičko sučelje za Python, a ono nije instalirano."

#: src/idscanner/app.py:23
msgid ""
"1. Select your scanner (the list is filled when the app starts; Refresh scanners\n"
"looks again), place the front of the card face down on the glass, and close the lid.\n"
"2. Click Scan front, turn the card over, then click Scan back.\n"
"3. Check the preview and choose Save PDF…\n"
"\n"
"Either side can be scanned again or replaced independently.\n"
"Use Choose image… for phone photos or scans already on disk; a card photographed at\n"
"a slant is straightened. If no card is found in the image, the whole image is added\n"
"and the side is marked \"card not found\": take the photo on a plain background, or\n"
"crop it before importing.\n"
"\n"
"Print the PDF at 100% / actual size to keep the real card dimensions.\n"
"No scanner listed? Install SANE and check that it appears in scanimage -L."
msgstr ""
"1. Odaberite skener (popis se popuni pri pokretanju; Potraži skenere traži ponovno),\n"
"stavite karticu prednjom stranom prema staklu i zatvorite poklopac.\n"
"2. Kliknite Skeniraj prednju, okrenite karticu, zatim kliknite Skeniraj stražnju.\n"
"3. Provjerite pregled i odaberite Spremi PDF…\n"
"\n"
"Svaka strana može se ponovno skenirati ili zamijeniti zasebno.\n"
"Odaberi sliku… učitava fotografije s mobitela ili postojeće skenove; kartica\n"
"fotografirana ukoso se izravna. Ako na slici nije pronađena kartica, dodaje se cijela\n"
"slika i strana je označena s „bez kartice“: fotografirajte karticu na jednobojnoj\n"
"podlozi ili prije uvoza izrežite sliku.\n"
"\n"
"Ispišite PDF u 100 % / stvarnoj veličini da kartica zadrži svoje prave dimenzije.\n"
"Nema skenera na popisu? Instalirajte SANE i provjerite pojavljuje li se u scanimage -L."

#: src/idscanner/app.py:36
msgid ""
"Scan both sides of an ID card and save them on one A4 page as a PDF\n"
"at the card's real size.\n"
"\n"
"All image processing happens locally on your computer.\n"
"\n"
"Built with id2pdf and CustomTkinter.\n"
"License: GPL-3.0-or-later"
msgstr ""
"Skenira obje strane osobne iskaznice i sprema ih na jednu A4 stranicu kao PDF,\n"
"u stvarnoj veličini kartice.\n"
"\n"
"Sve slike obrađuju se samo na vašem računalu.\n"
"\n"
"Izrađeno s id2pdf i CustomTkinter.\n"
"Licenca: GPL-3.0-or-later"

